# ENTS SQL Query Reference for Automation Testing

Source: Confluence page "SQL Query Reference for Automation Testing" by Ruchi Malik.
The SQL is the same as on the page, with one change: the optional herd filter lines started with `//`, which Oracle does not read as a comment, so they now start with `--`.

| Query | Purpose | Main tables | Key filters | Returns | How to narrow it |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Agent Login | Herds handled by one agent login | `tden_owner_history`, `vwen_ent_sets`, `vwco_ents_herd_abls_rpt`, `vwco_ems_client_details` | `ent_num_ents > 10`, `herd_agt LIKE '%aga6525%'`, one row per herd, alive holder preferred | herd_number, Herd_Name, AddressLine1, Agent_Login | Change `aga6525` in both places; uncomment the `herd_number IN (...)` line for specific herds |
| Individual Login | Herds with their own online login | `vwco_ents_herd_abls_rpt`, `vwco_ems_client_details` | `herd_ols_login IS NOT NULL`, `start_date > '31-DEC-22'`, one row per herd | Login_ID, Name, herd_number, Address | Uncomment the `herd_number IN (...)` line for specific herds |
| ETF Login | Individual herds linked to an ETF, with the ETF username | `vwco_ents_herd_abls_rpt`, `tden_herd_etf_link`, `vw_sso_roles_for_user_ents`, `vwco_ems_client_details` | `cust_type = 'Individual'`, `hel_grantor_type = 1`, `hel_scheme_year = 2026`, `hel_txor_ents_allowed > 10`, `hel_herd_no NOT LIKE '2%'` | individual_login, herd_number, herd_name, ETF_Username | Uncomment the `ve.herd_id IN (...)` line for specific herds |

How the dedupe works (Agent and Individual Login): `herd_number_status` checks whether any client row for the herd has `death_indicator = 'Y'`. The final query keeps one row per herd, preferring the row with no death flag when a death exists, or the `'N'` row when none does, then the latest `start_date`.

## 1. Agent Login

```sql
WITH herd_numbers AS (
    SELECT DISTINCT ohs_herd app_from_herd
    FROM tden_owner_history,
         vwen_ent_sets,
         vwco_ents_herd_abls_rpt
    WHERE ohs_scheme_year = ent_scheme_year
      AND ohs_own_id = ent_own_id
      AND ohs_hist_no = ent_hist_no
      --AND ent_scheme_year = 2026
      AND ent_num_ents > 10
      AND ohs_herd = herd_id
      AND herd_agt LIKE '%aga6525%'
),
herd_number_status AS (
    SELECT t.herd_number,
           MAX(CASE WHEN t.death_indicator = 'Y' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) has_y
    FROM vwco_ems_client_details t
    JOIN herd_numbers i
      ON i.app_from_herd = t.herd_number
    GROUP BY t.herd_number
)
SELECT herd_number,
       initcap(payee_name) Herd_Name,
       initcap(addr1) AddressLine1,
       'aga6525' Agent_Login
FROM (
    SELECT t.*,
           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (
               PARTITION BY t.herd_number
               ORDER BY
                   CASE
                       WHEN s.has_y = 1 AND t.death_indicator IS NULL THEN 1
                       WHEN s.has_y = 0 AND t.death_indicator = 'N' THEN 1
                       ELSE 2
                   END,
                   t.start_date DESC
           ) rn
    FROM vwco_ems_client_details t
    JOIN herd_numbers i
      ON i.app_from_herd = t.herd_number
    JOIN herd_number_status s
      ON s.herd_number = t.herd_number
)
WHERE rn = 1
--AND herd_number IN ('D1074220','D2700981','D2361427')
;
```

## 2. Individual Login

```sql
WITH herd_numbers AS (
    SELECT vr.herd_ols_login Login_ID,
           vr.herd_id app_from_herd
    FROM vwco_ents_herd_abls_rpt vr
    WHERE vr.herd_ols_login IS NOT NULL
      AND vr.start_date > '31-DEC-22'
),
herd_number_status AS (
    SELECT t.herd_number,
           MAX(CASE WHEN t.death_indicator = 'Y' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) has_y
    FROM vwco_ems_client_details t
    JOIN herd_numbers i
      ON i.app_from_herd = t.herd_number
    GROUP BY t.herd_number
)
SELECT Login_ID,
       initcap(payee_name) Name,
       herd_number,
       initcap(addr1) Address
FROM (
    SELECT t.*,
           i.Login_ID,
           ROW_NUMBER() OVER (
               PARTITION BY t.herd_number
               ORDER BY
                   CASE
                       WHEN s.has_y = 1 AND t.death_indicator IS NULL THEN 1
                       WHEN s.has_y = 0 AND t.death_indicator = 'N' THEN 1
                       ELSE 2
                   END,
                   t.start_date DESC
           ) rn
    FROM vwco_ems_client_details t
    JOIN herd_numbers i
      ON i.app_from_herd = t.herd_number
    JOIN herd_number_status s
      ON s.herd_number = t.herd_number
)
WHERE rn = 1
--AND herd_number IN ('G1740503','Q1201540','L1582159')
;
```

## 3. ETF Login

```sql
SELECT t.individual_login,
       t.herd_number,
       t.herd_name,
       (
           SELECT username
           FROM tden_herd_etf_link, vw_sso_roles_for_user_ents
           WHERE hel_scheme_year = 2026
             AND hel_txor_ents_allowed > 10
             AND businessid = hel_etf_no
             AND hel_herd_no NOT LIKE '2%'
             AND hel_etf_no = t.etf_no
             AND ROWNUM = 1
       ) AS ETF_Username
       --,t.etf_no
FROM (
    SELECT ve.herd_ols_login individual_login,
           ve.herd_id        herd_number,
           (
               SELECT initcap(cd.payee_name)
               FROM vwco_ems_client_details cd
               WHERE cd.herd_number = ve.herd_id
                 AND ROWNUM = 1
           ) AS herd_name,
           (
               SELECT hel_etf_no
               FROM tden_herd_etf_link
               WHERE hel_herd_no = ve.herd_id
                 AND ROWNUM = 1
           ) AS etf_no
    FROM vwco_ents_herd_abls_rpt ve
    WHERE 1 = 1
      AND ve.cust_type = 'Individual'
      AND ve.herd_ols_login IS NOT NULL
      --AND ve.herd_id IN ('H2311293', 'H2590656')
      AND ve.herd_id IN (
          SELECT DISTINCT hel_herd_no
          FROM tden_herd_etf_link
          WHERE hel_grantor_type = 1
      )
) t;
```

## Notes

| Point | Detail |
|---|---|
| Date filter in Individual Login | `start_date > '31-DEC-22'` depends on the session date format (NLS). `start_date > DATE '2022-12-31'` works in any session. |
| ETF_Username can be empty | The username subquery also needs `hel_scheme_year = 2026` and more than 10 entitlements, so herds whose ETF misses those rules return NULL. |
| Scheme year | ETF Login is fixed to 2026. Change `hel_scheme_year` each year. |
